		<ANNOTATION>
			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a111" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts220" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts221">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>But part of that comes clear I mean the peculiar thing about Tarsky's definition of truth is I once said in a paper that I thought should have been called the nonsemantical definition of truth which obviously confused the discussion by calling it the semantical conception truth because the striking thing of the definition is that no semantical notion occurs in the definition.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
				</ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
