				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don't think that's right at all and then I have a chapter on why you couldn't use a Tarskian notion of Truth or Davidson's purposes in a representation of reality or form goes through detail show what those wrong plot Tarskian divides the language as the notion of truth there is so many in meanings here that Davidson's theory really requires an intuitive notion of truth which is quite different than the formal replacement you get from Tarvsky's work.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
